  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">该模组旨在让玩家感受到中世纪骑士的氛围。目前，本模组包含大量新旗帜图案、16套护甲、8种盾牌和26种武器，其中大部分可由11种可用材料制作：木材、石头、铁、金、钻石、下界合金、钢（新增）、铜、银、锡、青铜。这些武器具有特殊功能，如增加攻击范围和破甲效果。此外，模组还新增了钢这一材料，不会与其他模组的钢产生冲突。要制作钢，请将铁锭放入高炉中。使用本模组，你可以将旗帜附着在护甲或马铠上（如同在盾牌上一样），或添加护甲装饰——其中许多装饰可染成任意颜色。配置文件位于<code>config/epicknights</code>文件夹中。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>附属模组：<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Addon</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-dark-ages-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Dark Ages</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-slavic-armory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Slavic Armory</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-antique-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Antique Legacy</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-ores-and-alloys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Ores and Alloys</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-artillery-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Artillery Addon</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rk-medieval-boomsticks-and-sharpsticks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ranged Knights Medieval Boomsticks and Sharpsticks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-open-helms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Open Helms</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>重要提示：OptiFine 1.20及更高版本会导致包括本模组在内的许多模组出现故障！<br></strong></span>自7.0版本起，本模组需安装Architectury和Cloth Config。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Roadmap.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jLgF2Sp/discord-new-2021-logo-45-D326-F28-C-seeklogo-com.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">如果你正在寻找一个使用Epic Knights护甲及其所有附属模组的服务器，欢迎了解<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agVWxf8VGc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Greatest of Centuries</a>。这是一个以派系为核心的服务器，致力于通过独特的机制和玩家驱动的角色扮演，重现君士坦丁堡陷落时期的冲突。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Compatibilities.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a><strong>：</strong>1.18.2以上版本：提供预设支持。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>：<br>1.20.1和1.21.1：提供预设支持</p><p>要在旧版本中将Epic Knights与Epic Fight结合使用，请按以下步骤操作：</p><p>1.12.2：从<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>下载epicfight.cfg文件，并将其放入configs文件夹。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">1.16.5、1.18.2、1.19.2：从<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>下载数据包，解压后按照教程操作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTutorials%252fInstalling%252f_a%252f_data%252f_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.fandom.com/wiki/Tutorials/Installing_a_data_pack</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">32x32资源包</a> 由Reymecos制作的32x资源包，注重细节：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overgeared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgeared</a>：<br>使用以下数据包使Overgeared与Epic Knights兼容：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Armor.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/478/sprite-0001-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3600\" height=\"3600\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Weapons.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1022/118/weapons-and-shield.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Designs.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/397/342/2021-09-26_19.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"1243\"></strong>如有任何BUG，请向我汇报！！！ 是的，你可以在CurseForge和Modrinth上发布的整合包中使用本模组。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
